sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Platform as opendatahub-operator /<br/>rhods-operator
    participant API as kube-apiserver<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Module as Module Operator<br/>(/manager)
    participant Webhook as Operand Webhook Svc<br/>443→9443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>(openshift-monitoring)
    participant OpMetrics as Operand Metrics Svc<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    actor Admin as Cluster Admin

    Note over Platform,Module: Flow 1 - Platform enables the component
    Platform->>API: Create MCPLifecycleOperator/default + ConfigMap odh-mcplifecycleoperator-config<br/>HTTPS 6443, SA token
    API-->>Module: Watch event (MCPLifecycleOperator)<br/>HTTPS 6443, SA token
    Module->>API: GET APIServer TLS profile, list MCPGatewayExtensions / Gateways
    Module->>API: SSA apply CRDs, RBAC, Deployment, Services, cert-manager CRs, VWC, ServiceMonitor, NetworkPolicy
    Module->>API: GC stale labelled resources, check operand Deployment readiness
    Module->>API: LIST mcpservers at v1beta1 (paginated, 500/page)
    API->>Webhook: POST /convert<br/>TLS (cert-manager CA), apiserver client
    Webhook-->>API: Converted objects
    API-->>Module: LIST succeeds → conversion verified
    Module->>API: Patch status (conditions, distribution, releases, availableMCPGateways)<br/>create StorageVersionMigration mcpservers-v1beta1
    API-->>Platform: status.distribution (version handshake)

    Note over Prom,OpMetrics: Flow 2 - Metrics scrape
    Prom->>OpMetrics: GET /metrics<br/>HTTPS 8443, TLS mcplo-metrics-server-cert, Bearer token
    OpMetrics->>API: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview<br/>HTTPS 6443, SA token
    API-->>OpMetrics: Allowed
    OpMetrics-->>Prom: Metrics

    Note over Admin,Module: Flow 3 - Cluster TLS profile change
    Admin->>API: Update APIServer/cluster spec.tlsSecurityProfile<br/>HTTPS 6443, user token
    API-->>Module: Watch event (SecurityProfileWatcher)
    Module->>Module: Cancel manager context → process restart, reload metrics TLS
    Module->>API: Re-render operand with new TLS_* env (rollout)
